  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Troccas. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Troccas is a traditional Swiss Tarot game played in the Romansh-speaking Surselva region of Grisons. It uses a 78-card Swiss 1JJ Tarot deck with Italian suits. Notable for the 'King and Jack Rule' (King demands Jack surrender) and coded signals (Tschintschar). Partnership play for 4.",
    objective: 'Score more card points than opponent team (target 36 to break even).',
    gameplay: 'Follow suit. Must trump if void. Fool excuses from following. King and Jack Rule: When King is first played in a suit, winner demands the Jack of that suit. Counterclockwise play.',
